The Rust evidence slice is complete at the post-phase-4 working tree:

- `cargo nextest run -p ckb-chain -p ckb-sync -p ckb-shared -p ckb-rpc
  -p ckb-launcher -p ckb-verification-contextual --no-fail-fast`: 175/175
